              "text": "Because Domino\u2019s Pizza operates on a franchise model, **most alphanumeric discount codes are store-specific**. A code that gives 30% off in Dublin might not work in Cork or Galway, and national codes are frequently updated. \n\nTo get the best discount on your order right now, the most effective national deals, student discounts, and hacks can be used to find active codes for your specific local store:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Active National Deals & Bundles (No Code Required)\nDomino's runs ongoing national bundle deals that often work out cheaper than applying a percentage-off code. You can find these in the **\"Deals\"** section of the Domino's website or app:\n\n*   **Two for Tuesday:** Buy one pizza, get one free (on medium and large pizzas) every Tuesday.\n*   **Pizza Legend Discount:** Usually gets you **30% off** when you custom-build a Pizza Legend online.\n*   **Extreme Mega Deal (\u20ac33.99):** 1 Large pizza, 1 Medium pizza, 2 sides, and cookies.\n*   **Large Double Deal (\u20ac32.99):** Any 2 large pizzas.\n*   **The Big Deal (\u20ac27.99):** 1 Large pizza, garlic pizza bread, potato wedges, and 4 cans of drink.\n*   **Meal Deal for Two (\u20ac19.99):** 1 Small pizza, 2 personal sides (garlic pizza bread, wedges, or dough balls), and 2 drinks.\n*   **Local Collection Special:** Many stores offer a small pizza for collection for only **\u20ac9.50**.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Student Discounts (35% Off)\nIf you or anyone in your household is a student, you can easily get **35% off orders over \u20ac25 / \u00a325**:\n*   **How to get it:** Log into **UNiDAYS** or **Student Beans**.\n*   Search for \"Domino's\" to generate a unique, single-use 35% discount code.\n*   Paste this code at the checkout on the Domino's website or app.\n\n---\n\n### 3. How to Find Alphanumeric Codes for Your Local Store\nIf you want a flat discount (like 30% or 40% off your entire basket), use these tools to find codes active at your nearest branch:\n\n*   **Let the \"Deal Wizard\" Do It:** Add everything you want to your basket on the Domino\u2019s app/website and go to checkout. The built-in *Deal Wizard* automatically scans and applies the best bundle deal to save you the most money based on what you\u2019ve ordered.\n*   **Use the Domino\u2019s Voucher Finder:** Tools like the **Latest Deals Domino\u2019s Voucher Finder** allow you to input your exact postcode or store location. It searches a database of user-submitted codes to find the exact ones that are currently active for your local branch.\n*   **Check Local Forums:** \n    *   **Reddit:** Check the subreddits **`r/DominosCodesIreland`** or **`r/TakeawayCodesIreland`**, where users regularly post codes they've received in the mail or via SMS. \n    *   **Boards.ie:** The \"Dominos Pizza Codes\" thread on Boards.ie is highly active with people sharing regional codes.\n*   **Irish Voucher Sites:** Check sites like **Picodi Ireland**, **Love Vouchers (IE)**, or **Promotional Codes Ireland**. They list the most recently tested community codes (e.g., codes for 30% off when you spend over \u20ac30). \n\n*Tip: Before finalizing your order, always make sure to toggle between delivery and collection, as many of the best local discount codes are strictly collection-only!*",
